<Layout title="Our approach — The Curated Pick">
  <article class="prose wrap"><p class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</p><h1>Good things.<br /><em>A little easier to find.</em></h1><p>The Curated Pick is an independent collection of things that catch our eye: useful details, considered design, and little additions to everyday life.</p><p>We bring the discovery together in one place. When a product interests you, its page shows the stores where you can explore it further. You choose where to shop.</p><h2>Discovery here. Shopping there.</h2><p>We are not the seller. We do not take payments or handle orders, shipping, warranties, or returns. Those belong to the store you choose. Always check the listing for the exact model, variation, availability, and purchase terms.</p><h2>A note about our links</h2><p>Some of our store links are affiliate links. If you shop through them, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. <a href="/disclosure/">Read our affiliate disclosure.</a></p><p>Our product descriptions are short introductions, not claims that we personally tested every item. Prices and availability are shown by the stores themselves.</p><a class="pill-button" href="/#discover">Explore the finds ↗</a></article>
</Layout>
